# GovJobPulse — environment variables
# This file grows phase by phase. Only vars actually consumed by code
# in the current phase are listed — no speculative/future vars.
#
# NODE_ENV — runtime mode for all apps. One of: development | production | test
NODE_ENV=development

# DATABASE_URL — Postgres connection string used by @govjobpulse/database
# (Prisma). Local dev example (matches docker-compose service name once
# that exists; for now, whatever your local Postgres is):
DATABASE_URL="postgresql://postgres:postgres@localhost:5432/govjobpulse"

# Vars for REDIS_URL, JWT_SECRET, notification provider credentials, etc.
# will be added in the phases that introduce the code that consumes them
# (Phase 4/8 queue, Phase 14 auth, Phase 8 notifications, ...).
# See CLAUDE.md "Environment variables" section for the running log.
